    "identifier": "medical-release-corrupt-missile",
    "description": "<p>You begin to generate a mass of twisted medical release chakra designed to be fired like a missile, bolt or beam.</p>\n<p>Make a ranged ninjutsu attack targeting one creature you can see in range. On a hit you deal 3d8 poison damage and the affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining a rank of Envenomed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d8. If this jutsu its cast at C-Rank or higher, On a hit a creature damaged by this jutsu suffers a 1d4 penalty to their next attack roll or skill check until the end of their next turn. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, if the affected creature would regain hit points, they instead regain 0 hit points. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher, increase the number of creatures you can target by +1.</p>",
